---
const currentYear = 2026;
---

<footer class="mt-auto w-full bg-[#efece4] border-t-4 border-[#1a1816] pt-10 pb-8 text-[#1a1816] text-sm font-sans">
  <div class="gazette-container">
    <!-- Top Colophon Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 pb-8 border-b border-[#d6d1c7]">
      <!-- Column 1: Bureau Identity -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 mb-2">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-[#1a1816] text-white text-xs font-mono font-bold">IMPRESSUM</span>
          <span class="font-serif font-bold text-lg">机场梯子 · 调查报社公报</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#57534e] leading-relaxed max-w-md">
          立足于客观事实与公开技术资料的中文网络节点数据档案所。以新闻调查式的严谨态度梳理服务商套餐、线路机制与真实协议，坚决杜绝商业化打分天梯与虚构测速。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 text-xs text-[#78716c] font-mono leading-normal bg-white/60 p-2.5 border border-[#d6d1c7]">
